questions.question:
What is the exact console output order of the following code?
```js
console.log(1);
setTimeout(() => console.log(2), 0);
Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log(3));
console.log(4);
```

What is the output order of this code?
```js
setTimeout(() => console.log('A'), 0);
Promise.resolve().then(() => {
  console.log('B');
  Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log('C'));
});
console.log('D');
```

What is the output of the following code?
```js
for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
  setTimeout(() => console.log(i), 100);
}
```

What is the output when changing `var` to `let` in the loop?
```js
for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
  setTimeout(() => console.log(i), 100);
}
```

What is the output of this code?
```js
const obj = {
  num: 42,
  getNum: function() {
    return this.num;
  }
};
const f = obj.getNum;
console.log(f());
``` in non-strict browser mode.

What is the output of this code?
```js
const obj = {
  num: 42,
  getNum: () => {
    return this.num;
  }
};
console.log(obj.getNum());
``` in global module scope where globalThis.num is undefined.

What is the output of the following code?
```js
function Person() {}
Person.prototype.age = 30;
const p1 = new Person();
Person.prototype = { age: 40 };
const p2 = new Person();
console.log(p1.age, p2.age);
```

What is the output of this code?
```js
async function foo() {
  console.log(1);
  await null;
  console.log(2);
}
console.log(3);
foo();
console.log(4);
```

What is the output of this generator invocation?
```js
function* gen() {
  const x = yield 10;
  yield x + 5;
}
const g = gen();
console.log(g.next().value);
console.log(g.next(20).value);
```

What is the output of this code?
```js
const obj = {
  log: ['a', 'b'],
  get latest() {
    return this.log[this.log.length - 1];
  }
};
console.log(obj.latest);
```
